### Acceptance Criteria Verification

✅ **Export job streams hot + archived data (JSONL/CSV) with manifest**
- DataExportResource creates export requests
- ComplianceService (pre-existing) handles job processing
- Streams to R2 with tenant-prefixed keys
- Manifest includes schema, checksums, record counts

✅ **Delete job soft-deletes, triggers purge per retention**
- Two-phase deletion implemented via ComplianceService
- Soft-delete marks records with `deleted_at`
- Scheduled purge after 90-day retention
- Audit logs preserved with PII anonymization

✅ **UI shows active sessions, revoke button, and privacy controls**
- AccountSecurityView.vue displays all active sessions
- Revoke button for individual sessions
- "Revoke All" option available
- Privacy controls for export/delete requests
- Status tracking and polling

✅ **Audit logs capture all actions**
- All privacy operations logged via platform_commands
- TenantContext verified on every request
- Actor, timestamp, rationale recorded
- Queryable for compliance audits

✅ **Documentation outlines encryption key rotation schedule + manual overrides**
- Annual rotation schedule documented
- Automated rotation script with 7 steps
- Manual emergency override procedure
- Monitoring alerts at 400/450 days
- Re-encryption job details

